Package: tdai-memory
Version: 1.0.2
Section: database
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: TencentDB Agent Memory Team
Depends: bash, ca-certificates, curl, libstdc++6, systemd
Description: TencentDB Agent Memory native services
 Four-process local deployment of MemoryCore, MemoryKnowledge,
 MemoryPanel and MemoryProxy with a bundled Node.js 22 runtime.
 Configuration, SQLite data and logs are stored under /opt/tdai-memory.
